draw(Circle(A,1));
draw(Circle(B,3));

dot("$a$", A, SW);
dot("$b$", B, NE);
dot("$z$", Z, E);
dot("$w$", W, S);
[/asy]

Hence, the smallest possible value of $|z - w|$ is $\boxed{\sqrt{185} - 4}.$

